          },
          "docs": "This endpoint allows you to create a new member. Members are created with the required parameters credentials and institution_code, and the optional parameters id and metadata. When creating a member, youll need to include the correct type of credential required by the financial institution and provided by the user. You can find out which credential type is required with the `/institutions/{institution_code}/credentials` endpoint. If successful, the MX Platform API will respond with the newly-cr"
