                "type": "path",
                "description": "The unique identifier for the member. Defined by MX."
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Calling this endpoint initiates an aggregation-type event which will gather the member's rewards information, as well as account and transaction information. Rewards data is also gathered with daily background aggregations."
        },
        {
